type: software
title: "Elyvris: an open workshop for computational photonics"
abstract: >-
  Free browser tools for computational photonics. Studio places 3D shapes
  with materials and writes the matching gdsfactory layout script, GDS file
  and Meep geometry list. Studio draws; it does not simulate.
